2:T71b,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does a Wickes fitted kitchen cost including installation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"As a rough guide, a typical UK complete fitted-kitchen project may cost around £8,000 to £25,000 or more, including products and fitting. Every project differs, and the final amount depends on size, specification, appliances and any building work. Get a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing for your project."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a Wickes kitchen installation include removing the old kitchen?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Check the current written quotation and terms. Removal, disposal and skip hire may be separate items or subject to an allowance, so they should not be assumed to be included."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are appliances included in a Wickes kitchen price?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Check the written design and quotation. Appliances and their connections may be priced separately from kitchen furniture and installation, depending on the items selected and the scope quoted."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is it cheaper to use an independent kitchen fitter than Wickes?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It can be, but there is no universal answer. Compare the complete scope, including preparation, plumbing, electrics, tiling, disposal, worktops and decorating, rather than labour prices alone."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What can make a fitted kitchen quote increase?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Common causes include moving services, repairing walls or floors, upgrading electrics, structural alterations, premium worktops, extra tiling, disposal and unforeseen problems behind the old units."}}]}7:["slug","how-much-is-a-fitted-kitchen-from-wickes","d"]
