niture is not necessarily the price of a fully finished room, so check what work, products and connections are included."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["As a rough guide, a typical UK small kitchen with standard units and laminate worktops may cost roughly £5,000 to £10,000 before all building and finishing work is included."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A typical UK mid-range fitted kitchen with more units, upgraded worktops and several integrated appliances may cost roughly £10,000 to £18,000 in total."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["A larger or higher-specification kitchen, particularly with quartz or other premium worktops, may cost £18,000 to £25,000 or more."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Installation can represent several thousand pounds, depending on the number of trades, the kitchen layout and the preparation required."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Every project differs, so obtain a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br fro