ppliances or worktops, if specifically included."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Installation of base units, wall units, end panels, plinths, cornice and pelmets, where listed."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktop installation, with the method depending on the worktop material and design."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Connection of appliances, sinks, taps and waste pipes where the quotation allows for it."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Minor adjustments needed to install the new units in the planned layout, where included."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Basic making-good or finishing work only where it is clearly listed rather than assumed."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Common extras and exclusions to check carefully"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The difference between an initial kitchen price and the final invoice can come from work outside the agreed installation scope. Your existing room may not be level, the walls may need repair, or the new layout may require services to move. A quote can also exclude items that homeowners assume are included, such as painting, flooring and waste removal. Ask for each allowance to be stated in writing, including how unforeseen problems will be handled."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Old kitchen removal, skip hire and disposal of rubble or packaging."]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plastering, repairing damaged walls, levelling floors and making good after removal."]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Moving gas, water, waste or electrical supplies to suit a new layout."]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Upgrading the consumer unit, adding circuits or carrying out electrical work beyond the stated allowance."]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Structural work, such as removing a wall, installing a beam or altering a window or door opening."]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Flooring, wall tiling, splashbacks, decorating and final paintwork."]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Extra work caused by uneven walls, poor access, hidden leaks, damp or defective existing services."]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Appliance upgrades, specialist worktops, upstands, panels, lighting and accessories not included in the original design."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Wickes installation versus an independent kitchen fitter"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The fairest comparison is not simply a retailer's fitting figure against an independent fitter's labour price. Compare like for like: the same cabinet specification, appliances, worktop, preparation, waste removal, plumbing, electrics, tiling and decorating. An independent fitter may quote for labour only, while another quote may include products, installation and wider project coordination. An independent team may also be able to include wider renovation work under one quotation. This is why a lower initial figure is not automatically the lower finished cost."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"Questions to ask before accepting either quote"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-